{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"debug":1},true],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"zotero":1,"inscriptions":7,"isBulletin":122},{"title":2,"author":3,"date":4,"citation":5,"uri":6},"Un documento epigrafico inedito sulle terme di Agrigento","Caminneci, Parello, Soraci","2023","\u003Cspan>Valentina Caminneci, Maria Concetta Parello, e Cristina Soraci, «Un documento epigrafico inedito sulle terme di Agrigento», in \u003Ci>Indagini archeologiche nell’insula IV del Quartiere Ellenistico Romano di Agrigento, 2014-2018\u003C/i>, a c. di Valentina Caminneci et al. (L’Aquila: One Group Edizioni, 2023), 537–49\u003C/span>","https://www.zotero.org/groups/isicily/items/A7HRWIUH",[8],{"file":9,"uri":9,"title":10,"status":11,"editions":13,"editionAuthor":24,"type":25,"objectType":29,"material":33,"condition":40,"layoutDesc":41,"handNote":48,"date":62,"places":67,"geo":77,"country":72,"provenance":69,"provenanceGeo":81,"region":84,"settlement":74,"repository":85,"idno":89,"textLang":91,"tmNumber":40,"letterHeights":95,"publications":100,"zotero":102,"keywords":104,"html":114,"bibl":115,"bulletinDateSort":121,"citedRangeSort":116,"languageSort":92,"materialSort":34,"typeSort":26},"ISic001830","Building inscription of Martinianos",{"_":12},"draft",[14,16,18,20,22],{"type":15},"TM",{"type":17},"EDR",{"type":19},"EDH",{"type":21},"EDCS",{"type":23},"PHI",null,{"_":26,"ana":27,"ref":28},"building","#function.building","http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/typeins/lod/.html",{"_":30,"ana":31,"ref":32},"plaque","#object.plaque","http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/objtyp/lod/259",{"_":34,"ana":35,"type":36,"subtype":37,"ref":39},"marble","#material.inorganic.stone","stone.unspecified",[38],"unverified","http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/48.html","",{"layout":42},{"p":43,"rs":44,"damage":40},"Traces of three lines of ancient Greek are preserved, with guidelines above and below; upper, left and right margins are partially preserved. The text appears to maintain a consistent margin on the left, but not on the right.",{"_":45,"ana":46,"ref":47},"chiselled","#execution.chiselled","http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1",{"lettering":49,"dimensions":50},"Tall, regular, narrow letters, v-cut, with small serifs on the termination of strokes. Small deep triangular interpuncts. Alpha has broken bar; epsilon tall, narrow, with equal short horizontals; theta and omicron are rhomboid; mu has vertical first and last, with the diagonals starting below the top and only desencing to the mid-point; nu is similar; rho has small curved, closed loop; sigma is lunate but rectilinear, with very short horizontals.",[51,58],{"type":52,"l":53,"from":54,"to":55,"h":56,"unit":57,"atLeast":56,"atMost":56},"letterHeight","Line 1-2","line1","line2","110","mm",{"type":59,"l":60,"from":54,"to":55,"h":61,"unit":57,"atLeast":61,"atMost":61},"interlinear","Interlineation line 1 to 2","20",{"_":63,"notBefore":64,"notAfter":65,"evidence":66},"Dated by reference to Flavius Martinianos, consularis of Sicily between 352 and 358 CE (Soraci)",352,358,"prosopography",[68,73],{"_":69,"type":70,"ref":71,"region":72},"Agrigentum","ancient","http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462086","Sicilia",{"_":74,"type":75,"ref":76,"region":72},"Agrigento","modern","http://sws.geonames.org/6541860",[78],[79,80],37.32084,13.58876,[82,83],37.297649,13.591579,"Sicily",{"_":86,"role":87,"ref":88},"Parco Archeologico Valle dei Templi","site","http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/museum/200",{"type":90},"inventory",{"_":92,"mainLang":93,"languages":94},"Ancient Greek","grc",[92],[96,98],{"atLeast":97,"atMost":97},110,{"atLeast":99,"atMost":99},20,[101],"Caminneci, Parello, Soraci, 2023, Un documento epigrafico inedito sulle terme di Agrigento",[103],"A7HRWIUH",[105,106,107,26,30,34,108,109,110,111,109,112,113,93],"isic001830","building inscription of martinianos",{"_":12},"agrigentum","agrigento","sicilia","sicily","parco archeologico valle dei templi","ancient greek","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpar